      },
      "line_002": {
        "id": "line_002",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "你醒了？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_002:continue"
        },
        "x": 640,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_003": {
        "id": "line_003",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "彬彬？头……有点晕……我刚才是低血糖晕倒了吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_003:continue"
        },
        "x": 940,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_004": {
        "id": "line_004",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "是也不是。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_004:continue"
        },
        "x": 1240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_005": {
        "id": "line_005",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "等一下……我在哪里？你……要做什么？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_005:continue"
        },
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_006": {
        "id": "line_006",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "你们这些邪教徒，不准备演了？是不是现在要把我献祭给你们不可名状的神？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_006:continue"
        },
        "x": 1840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_007": {
        "id": "line_007",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "傻孩子，你怕是发神经了，说什么胡话呢。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_007:continue"
        },
        "x": 2140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_008": {
        "id": "line_008",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "是啊是啊，你最近一直精神状态不对劲。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_008:continue"
        },
        "x": 2440,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_009": {
        "id": "line_009",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "可能是刷题刷疯了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_009:continue"
        },
        "x": 2740,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_010": {
        "id": "line_010",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "而且你半夜翻我们东西，我们也注意到了，不知道是不是梦游。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_010:continue"
        },
        "x": 3040,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_011": {
        "id": "line_011",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "梦游的话感觉有点危险啊。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_011:continue"
        },
        "x": 3340,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_012": {
        "id": "line_012",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "你的调查笔记，并没有藏得很好呢。我都看到了，但是其实我们真不是邪教徒……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_012:continue"
        },
        "x": 3640,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_013": {
        "id": "line_013",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "医者不能自医，你可能治着治着病，就把自己搞精神病了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_013:continue"
        },
        "x": 3940,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_014": {
        "id": "line_014",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "然后刚才你在宿舍突然晕倒了。总之我们三个决定打120把你送到医院，住院治疗。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_014:continue"
        },
        "x": 4240,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_015": {
        "id": "line_015",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "别骗我，我是清醒的！你们才是疯子，邪教徒！……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_015:continue"
        },
        "x": 4540,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_016": {
        "id": "line_016",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "binbin",
          "text": "额，主任，总之就是这么个情况。您……看着办吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_016:continue"
        },
        "x": 4840,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_017": {
        "id": "line_017",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "awei",
          "text": "总之是把他送过来了。我们几个才疏学浅，治他的精神病还得需要专业团队。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_017:continue"
        },
        "x": 5140,
        "y": 40
      },
      "line_018": {
        "id": "line_018",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "ending-screen",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "吃人的书！血祭的证据！所有线索都对上了，GTP说我是对的，你们骗不了我……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_018:continue"
        },
        "x": 5440,
        "y": 40
      },
